  - name: Xci
    type: method
    description: Concept-Concept co-occurrence counts, incremented for each word pair (i, j) in an image from VisualGenome, where (i, j) belongs to the synset pairs (Sc1, Sc2) in C x C, where C is the union of all object synsets annotated in an image.
  - name: Xoh
    type: method
    description: Object-Hypernym co-occurrence counts, incremented for each word pair (i, j) in an image from ImageNet, where (i, j) belongs to the synset pairs (Sh1, Sh2) in H x H, where H is a set of object synsets annotated for an image in ImageNet and its ancestors in WordNet.
